<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">AYakubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">AYak</para>
  <para style="toc2">AYakubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aYakubu Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYakubu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aYakubu Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk aYakubu, asam Adakunom ne asam aTisa aYeso Kristi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Imi tsin jɛk iko sak ni icɛn kusɔk abe afaa bafi izɔrɔk baYahuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk">icɛn kusɔk abe afaa bafi izɔrɔk baYahuda</char>: <char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛ́ ba yet bafi ikuus.</char></note>, yɔng fɛ́ ba se sharatat ni mben zizɛɛt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Show yin!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inɔɔk atsak ni izen imara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Ábaruneng, nye yin iyɛ ikan, ngma izen fi i nyim yin ne kaakyi kuri imara, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />nek iyin rēn yin fok imara inɔɔk atsak yin, bang saas akabɔk yin rasak, <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />nek anɔng, wosong yin akabɔk yin na a ya kashon nɔng i da sot yin gbagba, nɔng i da shining yin na kaakyɛ abak vit ikyɛng fi ibit yin. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ke akak ayɛt yin bit kutsitsɛng kutsik, won na a ra awon na Adakunom nɔng a da ku nɔk. Nek Adakunom nesek kaangan ikyɛng fɛ́ a ra awon ni wu dang tsɛsɛk inɛn, a da ku nɔɔk. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ anet tsin tsɛt ikyɛng, won na a nɔɔk atsak vit inye digit, nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nye digit, a se tɛ kudúng ashi, fi kuwun fesem aze na aza. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Anet tɛ ayɔng bi di tɛ a da kyem a sɛ ikikak ni bɔk aTisa awo; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />ayet anet fɛ́ a bɛ kuyiring asa afaa, a kyem a nyeseng ni ikyɛng izining awo.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Won aruneng fɛ́ a yet akan, na a tsot kugwɔm nek Adakunom mi ku nɔk iratek. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Won arum ba na tsot kugwɔm fok Adakunom mi tun ito ice ni wu, nek iwu tsin gosok tɛ agam. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Nek kunom ya gbɛrɛy, ku wat ku koot agam e, ne ato me kpas, ni kusas e wat ku gang. Kpaf anɔng fɛ́ arum bi ka na gang ayit kutsɛt wu.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Adakunom da te awɛng na anet fɛ́ a te gbinding ni izen imara, nek ama fɛ́ a ya awɛng naton imara me, a bi sɛ izang kutset vit igang fɛ́ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ a bi nɔɔk bayɔng fɛ́ ba kushim.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ngma ayɔng fi imara ku bɛ́, anet e bi fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Adakunom di ki mara awo.&gt;&gt; Nek Adakunom nye akak anyas, ke na mara akak awo. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Kaangan ses imara, nek ikɔk kuyiring wu, ni ku ku kɔk ma ku ku sak a ra iduk ikyɛng. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ama fi ikɔk e mi shining, ni i ma tes inɛn. Ama fi inɛn e mi rasak, ni i ma bɛ́ ni iku.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ábaruneng, ba bi ki bɔrɔk yin awo. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kaakyi kunang kutek ni kugyat, ku nes azanɛn, ku nes narɔ Ada fɛ́ a nye mgbey, ayɔng fɛ́ da a shesheng nse tɛ nawu fɛ́ na serese awo. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />A ki nɔɔk yit kutset nek inɔɔk atsak yit ni ifɛ̀ wu, a sak in sot yit bafi imɛsɛng, ayɛt nzam nkyɔrɔk fi iwu nye.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sot yin bafi ira <optbreak /> Ifɛ̀ Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ábaruneng fi in ka ba shim makiyi, wes yin ato ni ikyɛng deng: Kaangan na a sot afi ifoos ziri ziri, a bi sot afi cɛɛt ni ibeseng iyɛ ziri ziri awo, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />nek ibeseng iyɛ anet awe bes ni kusot kutek fɛ́ Adakunom shim awo. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nek anɔng, won yin iras nggɔn imaan e, ne kaakyi kuri ntomong anyas. Ayɛt kameneng iyɛ, shan yin ifɛ̀ fɛ́ ba mi tuus ayɛt in, fi i da kyem i ki sheshek yin.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Da i bi wɔrɔk yin ace yin awo, ni foos yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom kyɛk awo, ikyɛng ira yet, sot yin bafi ira me. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ me kyɛk vit inye me, a se kpaf tɛ anet fɛ́ a yɛrɛ ice wu na amadubi, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />ama fɛ́ a gang iyere me, na tseng, na ma te burum nse ayisi wu. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Awɛt ngma anet fɛ́ a nɔɔk nhwyɛ wu ni imɛɛs ntsi ntek, ntsi ntek fi in bes ni ibisik, ne ya kashon i nye nɔng, da a sot anet ifoos e kyɛk na nye burum awo, kɛ a sot afi i inyes e, ba da ku te itek naton ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a se ni ira me.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a di fok iwu se ni kusot fɛ́ Adakunom shim, awɛt da a kyem ayit kanu wu awo, a tsin wɔrɔk ice wu kyɛk, irēn ikuus Adakunom wu yet ifɛ́ abap. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Kuri ikuus fɛ́ Ada Adakunom shan yet iyɔng fi i se vit karìk, ke ikyɛng icɛɛt ayi, iyɔng fɛ́ ba di gbingding bakumung nɛ nakpin ayɛt izot na, ni iyisik kurɔm vit imoon ice ayɛt ikyɛng fi i da ki beseng yit azatse kang.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Igyɔng naton ishim ice</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Ábaruneng, iyin fi i tsin ya yin kashon ni ikuus azɔk yit aTisa aYeso Kristi, i bi tonoso yin ishim ice awo. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Won nfɛ yit, anet akak bɛ narɔ inyim yin, a mi te itsɔm bɔk ifi itsɔm nɛ ares atek makiyi, na akan akak fɛ́ a te agyɛt ares bɛ́ a nɔ ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Ki i tonong yin ishim ice sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a te ares itsɔm ni fɛ̀ yin ni wu, &lt;&lt;Karɔ isonong karatek ka yet kafɔɔn,&gt;&gt; ni ma fɛ̀ yin na akan e, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tsi nyeseng aza&gt;&gt; ke ni fɛ̀ yin ni wu, &lt;&lt;Sonong aze aben bakat na atak hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Ki ira yin anɔng, a sot i mi tonong yin ishim ice yɔng awɛ, i mi tsɛɛt yin ishɔt ifɛ́ aduk kuyiring yɔng awɛ?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Wes yin ato, bacɛk iyɛ na baruneng hom! Adakunom mi kasa bakan azatse na ba sot barum ni inɔɔk atsak, iba ba fɛ̀ ba bi ya kurúm ni igwɔm Adakunom tɛ fɛ́ a kin fɛ̀ a bi nɔɔk bayɔng fɛ́ ba kushim awɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ngma na anɔng, iyin byɛs yin bakan. Ayet barum e ba ba ki mɔɔt yin awɛ? Iba ba ba ki kɔk yin sak na atu ishɔt awɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ayet iba ba ba cɛɛt ncɛɛt ibyes naton iyerek itek ifɛ́ aYeso awɛ? Ayet ni iyerek aYeso de fɛ́ ba ki yes yin mo awɛ?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />I da se gyat ki in nye yit ikyɛng fi i se ni ijɛk ni Ntsi Adakunom yɛ, &lt;&lt;Shim afidang isot ngɔn ti ice ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Awɛt ki itonoso yin ishim ice nate yin, i nye yin inɛn, ama anɔng ba mi ki ya yin ni ishɔt tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba dun ntsi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem a nye ntsi ngma, ama dun ni nzining kyɛk, a mi dun ni ishɛrɛp e ngma kusum. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Nek ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;I bi ra kujang awo,&gt;&gt; ke na fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;I bi fɛt anet awo.&gt;&gt; Ki da ngɔn ra kujang awo tit ifɛt anet kyɛk, ngɔn mi sot afi idun ntsi.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Nek anɔng, ayɛt icɛɛt ni ntomong yin, rēn yin fok ba bi ki ra yin ishɔt ni ntsi. Ntsi me nang bi ki bisik yin washak. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nek anet fɛ́ a se dang angmishish, ba bi ku ra ishɔt vit angmishish. Nek anet fɛ́ a bɛ angmishish, a fok inyim ishɔt Adakunom awo.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inɔɔk atsak <optbreak /> vit kutomong yet abap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Ábaruneng, igyat e yet akyɛ ke anet nye fok iwu bi inɔɔk atsak, wat vit kutomong fɛ́ a di ki tonong ɛ? Inɔɔk atsak kuri iyɔng da kyem i ku sheshek ɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Won in fɛ̀ yit aruneng ke anganeng akak ayi se vit ares ite ke nayak iya ayi. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Kɛ akak ayɛt yin fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Tsi tik kyang, Adakunom da te mɔɔ ni ihwya,&gt;&gt; vit ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye naton kudaam wu fɛ́ ba di, akyi ikyɛng itek dɔng a nye yɔng ɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Kpaf anɔng, inɔɔk atsak fi i se vit kutomong fi ku da tonong, yet kukom e.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Akak da kyem a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bɛ inɔɔk atsak, Imi ras ntomong ntek.&gt;&gt; Di tonong inɔɔk atsak ngɔn vit kutomong, imi da ka tonong inɔɔk atsak hom ayɛt kutomong fi in ras. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ngɔn nesek atsak fok Adakunom yet azining. I se gyat anɔng! Itseng ma i nesek atsak ni itiim irɔm.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Kushɔp kukak! Ngɔn shim fok ma ba da tonong ikikak fi i da di, nɔng i da ni i rēn fok inɔɔk atsak vit kutomong yet abap ɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />ADakunom kin fɛ̀ adakop yit aIbrahim se tabat na yisi wu, nek nggɔn ntek wu fɛ́ a kin di nabak ari wu aIshaku ni kuta ashosh awɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Kɔ di yin, fi inɔɔk atsak wu ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye in ra kutomong ngma na, inɔɔk atsak se ishining ni kutomong fɛ́ a ra. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Nek anɔng wu fi ifɛ̀ Adakunom di se ishining yɛ, &lt;&lt;AIbrahim nɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, na anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom fɛ̀ a se tabat na yisi wu,&gt;&gt; a tɛ a ku yes mo afidang Adakunom. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Kɔ di yin, anet se tabat ashon Adakunom nek ikyɛng fɛ́ ras, da nek inɔɔk atsak kyɛk aziye awo.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kpaf anɔng wu, fi inyak agwɔm aRahab kin se tabat, ama fɛ́ a kin nɔɔk batom baYahuda karɔ ifɔɔn ari wu, a tɛ a ka ba tsa ni irèn iduk awɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Tɛ anet fɛ́ a se dang kabik ni rɔm wu yet kukom e, kpaf anɔng, inɔɔk atsak fi i se dang ntomong yet kukom e.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Ilem yet kurong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ábaruneng, banet dot ayɛt yin bi sot bafi itees awo, nek iyin rēn yin, iyit bayɔng fi in tees yit bakak, ba bi ki ra yit ishɔt fi iwat ifi ishɛrɛp banet. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Nek ngma yit in yet yit bafi irat. Ke akak di se fɛ́ da a rasak ni icɛɛt awo, anet yɔng mi se kushining, a da kyem a bereng kurɔm wu ngma kusum.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />In tes yit itsaap iguk nanu ye, nɔng i da ki fok yit, nɔng in di ki tiri yit iye sak narɔ fi in shim yit. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Di yin ányin akyɛ-ashi, ngma ni kurasak na, ni kuri awun fɛ́ yirik ina, ngma na anɔng anet ikɔk e tiri iko ni kabi ishɛn sak narɔ fi iwu shim ku di tseng. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />I se anɔng, ilem yet ikyɛng ibaane ayɛt nkap irɔm anet awe, ngma na anɔng i bɛ̀ ito ice makiyi. Di yin kica irong, ka ya kayit burang. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Ilem yet kurong ice de, kazatse iduk e ayɛt nkap irɔm ngma, ilem de imak yet iduk e. Ibeseng anet awe kusum, ilem e de ibeseng nse ni nggɔn anet ni kurong, na ba sak ide naton kurong ari irong.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ngma nzam-nzam nkye awum, ne nanon aton aza, ni nkyɔrɔk fi in ngu aben, ni ìzos ayɛt ashi, ba kyem ba yɛbɛk ina, anet awe kyem a yɛbɛk ina, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />awɛt vit anet fɛ́ a mang kyem a yɛbɛk ilem wu. Ilem yet aduk ikyɛng fi da irɔɔn awo, ama anɔng, i bɛ̀ nadɔm fɛ́ i da kyem isok kutset.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ni ilem fi in di tere yit aTisa ne Ada yit, ni ide me fi in ti in di tosong yit banet fɛ́ Adakunom nye nabik wu. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Kanu kazining ka fɛ́ ka turung itere ni tok. Ábaruneng, i se kpaf anɔng awo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ibong icɛbɛt izining, kyem i nesek ashi atek na ashi ntɔk ɛ? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Ábaruneng, kakon atafo kyem ka tes ica ifat ɛ? Ke kakon anap tes ica atafo ɛ? Ba da kyem ba sɛ ashi ntɔk ni bong ashi atek awo.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsitsɛng atsak nes <optbreak /> na Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Angan ayɛt yin fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kutsitsɛng ni irēn ɛ? Won na a tonong ayɛt nggɔn ntek fɛ́ a bɛ̀, na ba di kuri ntomong nggɔn kuhwyɛ fi ku ses ni kutsitsɛng e. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Awɛt ke aduk naman ni ishim ice ye fi i se ayɛt ayɛ yin, won yin itsot agwɔm ni nyɔ yin atsak. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Kuri kutsitsɛng kuyɔng nes narɔ Adakunom awo tit kufe azatse, ku yet kufe kabik Adakunom awo, ku yet kufe aShetan. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Nek karɔ fi imak ni ishim ice di se, i se gbing-gbing na ba sɛ idoro kuhwyɛ ni ntomong anyas azɔng.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Awɛt kutsitsɛng fi ku nes narɔ Adakunom, ni imɛsɛng e, ku se jɛrɛ, ama anɔng, ku bes ni kusot kukyang, ku bɛ̀ nhwyɛ, ku bɛ̀ ice ikyang, na angmishish, ku ras ntomong ntek. Vit iko ni ikasa bakak tit atsak. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Banet fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kusot kukyang, na ba tees bakak kusot kukyang, ba da se izang kutomong kutek ba.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Igyɔng naton ifidang <optbreak /> na kazatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Akyɛ fi ibes ni kuren ni ifà nate yin ɛ? Ifà me nes nek kuri nzam-nzam ikɔk nkyɔrɔk fi ise ni itsom ayɛt ayɛ yin. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ites yin ayisi naton nkyɔrɔk vit isɛ me, nek anɔng, ifɛɛs yin bafidiin. Ibɛ yin kuhwye da isɛ yin awo, nek anɔng, ni kɔrɔng yin ni fɛs yin bafidiin. I ses yin awo nek i risim yin Adakunom awo. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />I risim yin, da i ni ses yin awo, nek i risim yin ni kuyiring kumaan e. Nɔng i di ki tarang yin kudaam ice yin naton nta irɔm yin kyɛk.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Iyin banet ira kujang! Iyin rēn yin fok ifidang ne kazatse yet iraye Adakunom awɛ? Ngma anet fɛ́ a kasa ibɔ ifidang na kazatse, a mi sot afi ifa ne Adakunom. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Ke iyin di yin tɛ Afumung Adakunom dun e fɛ́ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Adakunom bi ifup ishim makiyi naton Kabik wu fɛ́ a te ayɛt yit ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Awɛt a ki nesek yit itek dot. Nek anɔng fɛ́ afumung di cɛɛt yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">&lt;&lt;Adakunom rawu bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">fɛ́ ba kok ice ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">a nesek itek wu sak na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ ice ikyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nek anɔng, nabak yin ice yin sak na Adakunom. Rayin aShetan, a da teng a ki won yin. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Serek yin bakat na Adakunom, iwu da serek bakat ni iyin. Kusu yin mbɔk yin, iyin bafi inɛn, kusu yin ayɛ yin, iyin bafɛ́ ayɛ afifa. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Nye yin kusot iyɔm, ne kafa kawe, ne tos yin nek anɛn yin. Won imasang yin ni isot kanak, iyɛ ikan yin ni isot ibeseng iyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Men yin ice yin ashon aTisa, iwu da ki nɔɔk yin iratek.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ábaruneng, i bi nye yin amaan ifɛ̀ naton ace yin awo. Kaakye anet fɛ́ a tsɛt ibeseng arunyining afi ikuus, ke a tsɛt ite akak inɛn ayi, a se ni itsɛt ibeseng ntsi Adakunom, ama anɔng, a tsɛt ntsi Adakunom ni inɛn. Ngma izen fi itsɛt a ra ntsi Adakunom ishɔt, i tonong fok ngɔn nyes ikyɛng fi ntsi me fɛ̀ awo. Ama anɔng, ngɔn mi sak ice ngɔn i sot anet ira ntsi ishɔt. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Anet inesek ifɛ̀ ntsi ni ishɔt, a yet Adakunom aziwu kyɛk, iwu fɛ́ a kyem na nɔk kutset na sok kutset. Awɛt ngɔn yet angan fi ira afidang isot ngɔn ishɔt ɛ?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igyɔng naton itsot kugwɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Wes yin ato yin, iyin fi i nye yin ye, &lt;&lt;Atut ke natson ayi in bi tse yit ni wɔp ya, in da nye yit iyɛ azɔng, ni in tsin ra yit ijik, ma in tusung yit atsɔm gaan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Awɛt vit iyin ni kurēn ke akyɛ fi i bi te natson ɛ? In fɛ̀ ane ni ngane, kutset yin yet akyɛ? Iyin fi i se yin ti aming, fi ikpa yɔkɔnɔng ni wat i kana karak. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />I se yɛɛt ki i fɛ̀ yin ane, &lt;&lt;Kɛ aTisa shim, a ki won yit ayɛt bafi kutset, in bi nye yit ane ne ana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Awɛt di yin fi ikok ice naton, ni nye yin mgbep. Kuri ikok ice naton iyɔng se yɛɛt awo. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Nek anɔng, ngma anet fɛ́ a rēn ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt na a nye, awɛt a rawu dang ra ide, anɔng e sot inɛn ni wu.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Itabak sak na barum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Wes yin ato iyin barum! Tos yin ni tang yin nkun nek izot fi i bi bɛ́ naton yin. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Kurúm fi i bɛ̀ yin mi bush, ize mi ya ares yin. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ata asɛng yin ne ata akan yin mi beseng. Ibeseng na bi nɔɔk kanu icɛɛt naton yin, ibeseng e bi ya kurɔm in ti kurong. I mi tusung yin ace yin kurúm ni nnom igang e nang. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Fok yin, nanak banet fɛ́ ba bɔrɔng ntomong na akɔ yin, fi i rayin dang ka ba tarang yin izang ba nek fi ka ba moot yin mo nanyas. ATisa Azɔk-Bazɔk aton aza mi fok kanak banet fɛ́ ba kiri tusung yin nayak akɔ yin. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />I nye yin kusot iya nta azatse, i ya yin ni sɔ yin ikyɛng fi iyɛ yin shim. I se yɛɛt anɔng akabɛs, i mi nok yin nrɔm yin, i tsin tot yin kunom fɛ́ ba bi ki tsɛk yin. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />I mi tɛmɛng yin banet fɛ́ ba ki ra yin inɛn ikak awo ishɔt, i mi ka ba fɛs yin.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye yin akabɔk ayɛt <optbreak /> isɔ mgbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, nye yin kusot akabɔk ni tsin di tot yin ku bɛ́ aTisa. Di yin kuri akabɔk fɛ́ anet ikɔ nye na tsin di tot nayak ikɔ wu na na ben. A nyes akabɔk itot iza shik ni iza ishamang. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Nek anɔng, i se yɛɛt iyin ni i nye yin kusot akabɔk ba. Bang yit yin ayɛ, nek ku bɛ́ aTisa yit bɛ́ bakat.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ábaruneng, i bi ras yin nanan na bafidang awo, kɔn ishɔt bi ki ya yin. Di yin, Anet ishɔt bɛ́ bakat ibes wu, a se ni inyeseng atitu! <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ábaruneng, kuus yin nggɔn batan fɛ́ ba kin shara ifɛ̀ naton aTisa. Mɛɛs yin nggɔn akabɔk fɛ́ ba kin nye ayɛt mgbang. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Nek ba yes bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye akabɔk ayɛt mgbang bafɛ́ awɛng. Iyin ki mang fok yin kuri akabɔk fɛ́ aYuba kin nye, itu fok yin kuri itek fɛ́ Adakunom ku te ne. Nek aTisa yet afi ifoos angmishish banet gyet awo.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Ábaruneng, igbat e yet, da i bi nye yin kushi na kazanɛn ke na kazatse ke ni ikikak awo. Won &lt;&lt;Ey&gt;&gt; yin na a sot ey, nɛ &lt;&lt;Awey&gt;&gt; yin na a sot awey, ke da anɔng awo ishɔt bi ki ya yin.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye yin awon <optbreak /> ni inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ke akak ayɛt yin se ayɛt mgbang ɛ? Won na a ra awon. Ke akak ayɛt yin bi iyɛ ikan ɛ? Won na a ra abom itere Adakunom. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ke akak ayɛt yin se ni irɔk ɛ? Won na a yes bashɔn bafi ikuus na ba ku ra awon, na ba di korok name naton wu ni iyerek aTisa. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Awon fɛ́ ba ra ayɛt inɔɔk atsak da te anet irɔk kyang; aTisa da kudorok. Ke a mang ra inɛn, Adakunom da ku fuut ide.<verse eid="JAS 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nek anɔng, taas yin bafidang inɛn yin, ni ras yin awon naton bafidang nɔng i da ses yin kukyang. Awon anet atsak bɛ̀ agap, a ya hwyɛ awo. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />AIliya kin yet anet awe kpaf ti iyit. A kin ra awon atsak fok iza bi tik awo, ba won dang nye iza ni mben e ayɛ ataat ni ibit e. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />A tɛ a ra awon, kazanɛn korok iza, mben se kuyak. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Ábaruneng, ke akak ayɛt yin kpa ni irèn atsak, akak na a tse na bun ni iwu, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />yiring yin ni ifɛ̀ de: Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tirik anet inɛn ayɛt idun wu, a da ku sheshek kɔn a bi ku, anɔng e da sak Adakunom da yɛrɛ kudot anɛn wu awo.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>